## Atribuciones

Este proyecto utiliza las siguientes librerías de código abierto:

- **DeepXDE** - Lu Lu et al. (MIT License)
  https://github.com/lululxvi/deepxde

- **TensorFlow** - Google (Apache 2.0 License)
  https://www.tensorflow.org/

- **NumPy** - NumPy Developers (BSD License)
  https://numpy.org/

- **Matplotlib** - Matplotlib Development Team (PSF License)
  https://matplotlib.org/

## Referencias Académicas

Si usas este código para investigación, por favor cita:

1. **PINNs Original Paper:**
   Raissi, M., Perdikaris, P., & Karniadakis, G. E. (2019).
   Physics-informed neural networks: A deep learning framework for solving forward and inverse problems involving nonlinear partial differential equations.
   Journal of Computational Physics, 378, 686-707.

2. **DeepXDE:**
   Lu, L., Meng, X., Mao, Z., & Karniadakis, G. E. (2021).
   DeepXDE: A deep learning library for solving differential equations.
   SIAM Review, 63(1), 208-228.

3. **Lid-Driven Cavity Benchmark:**
   Ghia, U., Ghia, K. N., & Shin, C. T. (1982).
   High-Re solutions for incompressible flow using the Navier-Stokes equations and a multigrid method.
   Journal of Computational Physics, 48(3), 387-411.
